{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MistyPuzzle: A Zen Puzzle Odyssey</strong><br><i>A meditative puzzle experience with layered challenges</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in tranquil melodies and minimalist aesthetics - this sanctuary of relaxation challenges you to assemble shapes through strategic layer occlusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_1_.gif?t=1747145256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong><br>Deceptively simple, profoundly engaging:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop fragments from the palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate pieces to find perfect alignment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously rearrange layers to reveal hidden configurations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But be warned</strong> - these aren't ordinary puzzles. Our mind-bending structures will:<br>\ud83c\udf00 Challenge your spatial perception<br>\ud83c\udfaf Test your pattern recognition<br>\ud83d\udca1 Reward persistent problem-solvers<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_2_.gif?t=1747145256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 meticulously crafted chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120 evolving puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Easter eggs in every chapter <i>(Share your discoveries with fellow players!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_3_.gif?t=1747145256\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Final Note from Developers</strong><br>May this brief yet delightful journey grant you:<br>\ud83e\uddd8 A mindful escape from daily stresses<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Creative fulfillment through focused problem-solving<br>\u23f3 Precious moments of digital serenity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Perfect for: Puzzle enthusiasts seeking mental stimulation &amp; relaxation seekers needing cognitive decompression</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Timeless Voyage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/588d9fe5376400199a289f11ac522e3fc988e9e0.jpg"},{"name":"Tranquil Harmony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/b7ffaae84bd5bfa3cb0866e711007d7d71683e25.jpg"},{"name":"Lively Melody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/a68c9b437ef145064e9b7e78b81eb3199c8de4d2.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Repose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/f36a547f82776d84037b4d3dc1cb926ef39de25e.jpg"},{"name":"Frostbloom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/fedea6f1de8d1ad34782b99080791b2008b3536d.jpg"},{"name":"Harmonious Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/ab17d37bde738d10bb7d5d45a93f0ba1d059e78d.jpg"},{"name":"Epochal Threads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/f272b75269c1b02816d154365e16b6e619ddf2e6.jpg"},{"name":"Yuletide Joy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/e3132ced469670e9f08ba91f328414440d29069b.jpg"},{"name":"Ethereal Beings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/68af86a1f9a94613a07104de55d75a6b7f566a54.jpg"},{"name":"Spring Festival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2660630/44aa100e8cc17fe57a44f796c9be2da14ca2a75f.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s